  "shirogav/sh3": {
   "summary_en": "Two jackals, Kalila and Dimna, live among the lion's followers. The more ambitious Dimna asks why the king sits idle; Kalila tells him not to meddle in what is beyond his rank, and warns him with the story of an ape that tried a carpenter's work, was caught by a wedge, and was beaten to death.",
   "status": "draft",
   "translation_en": ""
  },
